{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A tiny village full of frogs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find My Frogs is set in a hand-drawn, tiny village called Moss Glade. Cradled in the roots of an ancient tree, it houses a charming community of frogs and toads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help Uncle Froger take a commemorative photo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130800/extras/truskaweczka_fmf.gif?t=1745257757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find all the frogs and toads, collect the camera parts along the way and capture the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lounge in the atmosphere of Moss Glade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130800/extras/wodospad_fmf_.gif?t=1745257757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a location, adjust the audio, set the day time and focus on your tasks, with Find My Frogs as the idle background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the hand-drawn world of Moss Glade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find</strong> 300+ Frogs and Toads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover</strong> 40+ hidden secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose</strong> between day or night, or let time flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax</strong> in a soothing atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With calming animations and sounds, soothing music, and playful interactions \u2013 such as helping a little frog pick strawberries \u2013 Find My Frogs offers a sweet moment of serenity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Find My Frogs is a passion project by a duo of artists.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3130800?t=1745257757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3130800?t=1745257757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130800/d9443263842f8caae57170aca1d46cdf594c6b3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745257757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130800/d9443263842f8caae57170aca1d46cdf594c6b3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745257757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A tiny village full of frogs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find My Frogs is set in a hand-drawn, tiny village called Moss Glade. Cradled in the roots of an ancient tree, it houses a charming community of frogs and toads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help Uncle Froger take a commemorative photo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130800/extras/truskaweczka_fmf.gif?t=1745257757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find all the frogs and toads, collect the camera parts along the way and capture the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lounge in the atmosphere of Moss Glade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130800/extras/wodospad_fmf_.gif?t=1745257757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a location, adjust the audio, set the day time and focus on your tasks, with Find My Frogs as the idle background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the hand-drawn world of Moss Glade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find</strong> 300+ Frogs and Toads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover</strong> 40+ hidden secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose</strong> between day or night, or let time flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax</strong> in a soothing atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With calming animations and sounds, soothing music, and playful interactions \u2013 such as helping a little frog pick strawberries \u2013 Find My Frogs offers a sweet moment of serenity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Find My Frogs is a passion project by a duo of artists.</i></p>","developers":["My Eye Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130800/header.jpg?t=1745257757","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257091583,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091583/movie480.mp4?t=1738856824","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091583/movie_max.mp4?t=1738856824"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091583/b2425c3690c4c82b81308c32cce3d1cdd973858c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738856824","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091583/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738856824","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091583/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738856824"}}],"name":"Find My Frogs","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements